  "notes": [
    "Ordinary MegaLabel and normal MegaRichTextLabel use regular Chinese locale substitution; authored English Spectral/Kreon/Bitter faces remain on English labels. Explicit rich bold spans retain face5.",
    "Nine-pixel Spectral titles require sparse_scene_sizes opt-in. Settings tab32→6; labels28→5; input command automatic fitting may use4; dropdown22→4; submenu32/24→6/5.",
    "The two supported Settings tabs and two host input banks retain source control sizes. Audio/video/controller columns are unavailable host capabilities.",
    "The General RESET_DEFAULT and Input INPUT_SETTINGS.RESET_TO_DEFAULT have identical source text in both supported languages; reuse the existing Input text slot for both.",
    "Dynamic alphabets cover physical keys, canonical seed ASCII, native language names and the daily calendar. Modifier titles/descriptions remain localized pack text.",
    "Daily icon numerals use the established4px calculator floor; source MegaLabel auto fitting is21px in English and18px in Chinese inside the28px label."
  ]
